AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m076-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"魯哀公","kind":"person","person_id":"wbr_1v1_sld","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong","book_id":"b-shiji-047","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p077","text":"哀公誄之曰：「旻天不弔，不愸遺一老，俾屏余一人以在位，煢煢余在疚。嗚呼哀哉！尼父，毋自律！」子貢曰：「君其不沒於魯乎！夫子之言曰：『禮失則昬，名失則愆。失志為昬，失所為愆。』生不能用，死而誄之，非禮也。稱『余一人』，非名也。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m077-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"哀公","kind":"person","person_id":"wbr_1v1_sld","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m077-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"尼父","kind":"person","person_id":"f8d_j5p_nop_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m077-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"子貢","kind":"person","person_id":"7c4_6v2_yvm","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong","book_id":"b-shiji-047","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-047-kong"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-047","source_id":"s-shiji-047-kong","source":{"title":"史記／卷047","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷047","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷047&oldid=7903609","revision_id":7903609,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"85段正文及1段索隱述贊，後者分層；排除2個dd導覽與現代分節標題，只去除段落外緣空白。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"取得時HTML與固定修訂一致；現代分節標題不作古代正文，原字與來源標點保留。","note":"已核讀全86段數位文字並作首輪明示人名標註；未核可靠底本、影像或現代研究。"}}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":false,"date_normalization_coverage":"partial","normalized_year_numbering":"ast